{"seq":2,"slug":"diversity-representativeness","title":"多样性与代表性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/active-learning-data-labeling/strategies/diversity-representativeness","wordCount":1758,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"多样性与代表性\">多样性与代表性</h1><p><a href=\"uncertainty-sampling\">不确定性采样</a> 留下一个尖锐的问题：模型最不确定的样本往往挤在决策边界的一小块区域，一批挑出来全是相似的近邻，标了一个其余的就没价值了。解决它需要一个完全不同维度的信号——不问「模型多困惑」，而问「这个样本跟已标的、跟整池的，有多不一样、多有代表」。多样性确保挑出的样本互相不重复，代表性确保它们覆盖数据的主要分布而非角落里的异常值。这一篇讲清这两个概念、它们的几种实现，以及为什么 2026 年的实践几乎都把它们和不确定性混在一起用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>困惑度和代表性是两个正交的信号。一个样本可以困惑但孤立（边界上的异常点，标了只解决它自己），也可以有代表但不困惑（分布中心的典型样本，模型早就会了）。理想的挑样要同时高困惑、高代表，且一批之内互相多样。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[未标池] --&gt; B[不确定性信号&lt;br/&gt;样本多困惑]&#10;  A --&gt; C[代表性信号&lt;br/&gt;样本多典型]&#10;  A --&gt; D[多样性约束&lt;br/&gt;批内互不相似]&#10;  B --&gt; E[混合打分&lt;br/&gt;困惑度 × 代表性]&#10;  C --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[候选排序]&#10;  D --&gt; G[贪心去冗余&lt;br/&gt;core-set / 子模选择]&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[挑出一批&lt;br/&gt;既困惑又有代表又多样]\">flowchart TD\n  A[未标池] --&gt; B[不确定性信号&lt;br/&gt;样本多困惑]\n  A --&gt; C[代表性信号&lt;br/&gt;样本多典型]\n  A --&gt; D[多样性约束&lt;br/&gt;批内互不相似]\n  B --&gt; E[混合打分&lt;br/&gt;困惑度 × 代表性]\n  C --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[候选排序]\n  D --&gt; G[贪心去冗余&lt;br/&gt;core-set / 子模选择]\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[挑出一批&lt;br/&gt;既困惑又有代表又多样]</pre><p>下表把三个概念的目标、典型方法和失败模式对齐，它们常被组合而非单用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>典型方法</th>\n<th>单用的失败模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>多样性</td>\n<td>批内样本互不相似</td>\n<td>core-set、聚类去重</td>\n<td>可能全挑简单样本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代表性</td>\n<td>覆盖高密度区域</td>\n<td>密度加权</td>\n<td>忽略困惑、标到模型早会的</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不确定性</td>\n<td>挑模型困惑的</td>\n<td>熵、BALD</td>\n<td>扎堆、挑到异常值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代表性-用密度加权\">代表性：用密度加权</h2><p>代表性的核心思想是：一个样本如果落在数据分布的高密度区域，它代表了很多相似样本，标它的回报会摊到一大片邻居上；反之落在稀疏角落的样本，可能是异常值，标它只解决它自己。密度加权（density-weighted）把这个直觉乘进不确定性分数里：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mtext>unc</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>U</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>∈</mo><mi>U</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo><mi>β</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(x) = \\phi_{\\text{unc}}(x) \\cdot \\Big(\\frac{1}{|U|}\\sum_{x&#x27; \\in U} \\mathrm{sim}(x, x&#x27;)\\Big)^{\\beta}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">unc</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7107em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6828em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.389em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.6029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>前一项是任意不确定性度量，后一项是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 与池中所有样本的平均相似度（即密度的代理），指数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 调节代表性的权重。这个乘积自然地压低了「困惑但孤立」的异常值的分数——它们不确定性高，但密度低，相乘后排不到前面。相似度通常在模型的隐层表示空间里算（余弦相似度），而非原始像素/词，因为表示空间更贴近模型眼中的「相似」。把数据投影到低维表示再算距离，这一步和 <a href=\"../../dimensionality-reduction/\">降维</a> 关系密切。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多样性-core-set-与几何覆盖\">多样性：core-set 与几何覆盖</h2><p>多样性换个问法：不看密度，而看「我挑的这一批，能不能像撒网一样均匀覆盖整个数据空间」。core-set 方法把它形式化为一个几何覆盖问题——挑一个子集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>，使得未标池里每个点到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 中最近点的距离都尽量小。形式上是最小化最大覆盖半径：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></munder><mtext>  </mtext><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>U</mi></mrow></munder><mtext>  </mtext><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mtext>  </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min_{S,\\,|S|=k} \\; \\max_{x \\in U} \\; \\min_{s \\in S} \\; \\lVert f(x) - f(s) \\rVert_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.716em;vertical-align:-0.966em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.309em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.966em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7717em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7717em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(\\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是模型的表示函数。这是经典的 k-center 问题，NP 难，但有简单有效的贪心近似（每次挑离当前已选集合最远的点），近似比为 2。core-set 完全不看不确定性，纯靠几何覆盖挑样，在深度学习里被证明对批量主动学习特别有效，因为它天然避免了批内冗余。代表性与多样性都依赖在表示空间里聚类或算距离，<a href=\"../../cluster-analysis/\">聚类分析</a> 的方法（k-means、层次聚类）在这里被直接复用——比如先把池聚成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 簇，每簇挑最不确定的一个。</p>\n<h2 id=\"混合策略-为什么-2026-年都这么用\">混合策略：为什么 2026 年都这么用</h2><p>纯不确定性扎堆、纯多样性可能全挑简单样本——两者的缺陷恰好互补，所以实践把它们组合。组合有两种主流范式。</p>\n<p><strong>加权乘积</strong>：像上面密度加权那样，把不确定性和代表性相乘成一个标量分数，再取 top-k。简单，但 top-k 仍可能扎堆（多样性约束不够硬）。</p>\n<p><strong>两阶段过滤</strong>：先用不确定性选出一个较大的候选池（比如 top-5k），再在候选池里用 core-set 或聚类挑出多样的 k 个。这种「先困惑后多样」的两段式在工程上最常用，因为它把昂贵的多样性计算限制在小候选池上。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组合范式</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>加权乘积</td>\n<td>不确定性 × 密度，取 top-k</td>\n<td>实现简单</td>\n<td>批内仍可能扎堆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>两阶段过滤</td>\n<td>先按不确定性筛大池，再 core-set 取多样 k</td>\n<td>平衡好、可控</td>\n<td>多一个超参（候选池大小）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>梯度嵌入（BADGE）</td>\n<td>在梯度空间同时编码困惑与多样</td>\n<td>一步到位</td>\n<td>计算较重</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三行的 BADGE 把不确定性和多样性统一进一个梯度嵌入空间，是批量场景的代表方法，专门留给下一篇 <a href=\"batch-mode-active\">批量主动学习</a> 深讲。值得强调的是，类别不平衡时代表性信号尤其重要——稀有类样本天然处于低密度区，纯密度加权会把它们埋掉，需要显式地保证稀有类的覆盖，这与 <a href=\"../../data-cleaning-preprocessing/quality-and-significance/data-quality-dimensions\">数据不平衡处理</a> 的考量相通。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个实践陷阱-表示空间会漂移\">一个实践陷阱：表示空间会漂移</h2><p>多样性和代表性都建立在「样本在表示空间里的距离」上，但这个表示空间是模型给的，而模型每轮都在变。第一轮算出的「多样」子集，到第三轮模型表示更新后可能不再多样。两个应对：一是每轮用当前模型重新计算表示和距离（计算贵但准确），二是用一个固定的预训练编码器（如 2026 年常用的多模态基础模型）提取稳定表示、只用它算多样性，把「困惑度随模型变、代表性用固定空间」解耦。后者在深度主动学习里越来越主流，因为基础模型的表示足够通用、稳定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>困惑度和代表性是正交信号：样本可以困惑但孤立、或有代表但不困惑，理想挑样要兼顾。</li>\n<li>密度加权把不确定性乘以样本的局部密度，自然压低「困惑但孤立」的异常值。</li>\n<li>core-set 把多样性形式化为 k-center 几何覆盖，贪心近似简单有效、天然避免批内冗余。</li>\n<li>2026 年实践主流是混合：加权乘积、两阶段过滤、或 BADGE 式梯度嵌入。</li>\n<li>表示空间随模型漂移是隐患，可用固定基础模型编码器解耦代表性与困惑度计算。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"uncertainty-sampling\">不确定性采样</a>——本篇要纠正的扎堆问题之源；<a href=\"batch-mode-active\">批量主动学习</a>——BADGE 如何统一困惑与多样。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../cluster-analysis/\">聚类分析</a>——表示空间聚类是代表性采样的直接工具。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多样性与代表性","id":"多样性与代表性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"代表性：用密度加权","id":"代表性-用密度加权"},{"level":2,"text":"多样性：core-set 与几何覆盖","id":"多样性-core-set-与几何覆盖"},{"level":2,"text":"混合策略：为什么 2026 年都这么用","id":"混合策略-为什么-2026-年都这么用"},{"level":2,"text":"一个实践陷阱：表示空间会漂移","id":"一个实践陷阱-表示空间会漂移"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"不确定性采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/active-learning-data-labeling/strategies/uncertainty-sampling"},"next":{"title":"批量主动学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/active-learning-data-labeling/strategies/batch-mode-active"}}